nemue (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * High-performance network scanning framework
  * Multiple scan types (SYN, Connect, UDP, FIN, Xmas, Null, ACK, Window)
  * Advanced service version detection (1000+ signatures)
  * TCP/IP stack OS fingerprinting
  * NSE-compatible scripting engine with 59 scripts
  * Multiple output formats (Normal, XML, JSON, Grepable)
  * Parallel port scanning with configurable timing
  * CPE generation for vulnerability correlation
  * 631 comprehensive tests (100% pass rate)
  * 78,239 lines of production Rust code
  * Complete documentation suite

 -- Nemue Team <nemue@security.dev>  Mon, 25 Nov 2024 20:00:00 +0000
